WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.804 --> 00:00:03.565
"Moo! Moo!"

2
00:00:03.585 --> 00:00:14.734
Mr. Mann heard his cows mooing in the field.

3
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.662
He ran outside and saw something flash across the sky.

4
00:00:38.603 --> 00:00:40.104
It shot straight toward his farm.

5
00:00:42.046 --> 00:00:43.266
"Oh no!"

6
00:00:43.827 --> 00:00:44.367
cried Mr.

7
00:00:44.387 --> 00:00:47.249
Mann. "Yuck!"

8
00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:48.370
said Jack.

9
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.912
"We're having sloppy joes for lunch today."

10
00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:55.555
It was Monday morning at Metro City Elementary School.

11
00:00:56.676 --> 00:00:58.177
The students were on their way to class.

12
00:00:58.197 --> 00:01:02.740
"Sloppy joes are the worst," said Mara.

13
00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.117
"They're so gross and they drip everywhere."

14
00:01:06.137 --> 00:01:09.999
"I wish Rocket Girl was here," said Terrell.

15
00:01:10.019 --> 00:01:13.060
"She could save us from those sloppy joes."

16
00:01:18.402 --> 00:01:20.903
Rocket Girl can do anything," said Jack.

17
00:01:22.444 --> 00:01:26.625
"Rocket Girl is the number one superhero in Metro City," said Mara.

18
00:01:30.727 --> 00:01:35.853
can fly, she's really strong, and she can shoot lasers out of her eyes.

19
00:01:36.714 --> 00:01:38.855
She has lots of other super powers too!"

20
00:01:42.937 --> 00:01:46.979
"Last week she stopped a big monster from stomping the school," said Terrell.

21
00:01:46.999 --> 00:01:53.043
"Rocket Girl once saved Metro City from giant robots," said Mara.

22
00:01:53.063 --> 00:01:56.585
"Remember when moon men were planning to blow up Earth?"

23
00:01:57.025 --> 00:01:57.545
asked Jack.

24
00:01:57.565 --> 00:02:02.188
"Rocket Girl flew to the moon and destroyed their Earth Blaster!"

25
00:02:04.884 --> 00:02:08.986
"You guys are always talking about Rocket Girl," Roxy said quietly.

26
00:02:09.006 --> 00:02:11.368
"But she's not perfect.

27
00:02:12.508 --> 00:02:14.790
She can't save us from sloppy joe day."

28
00:02:14.810 --> 00:02:17.251
"Are you kidding?"

29
00:02:17.671 --> 00:02:18.292
asked Mara.

30
00:02:18.312 --> 00:02:22.814
"I'll bet you're just jealous, Roxy," said Terrell.

31
00:02:22.834 --> 00:02:25.516
"Jealous?" asked Roxy.

32
00:02:25.536 --> 00:02:28.157
"Yes," said Terrell.

33
00:02:28.177 --> 00:02:32.960
"You're jealous because you're never around when Rocket Girl shows up.

34
00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:36.597
You probably wish you were Rocket Girl."

35
00:02:36.617 --> 00:02:39.939
"Me? Rocket Girl?"

36
00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.260
Roxy laughed.

37
00:02:42.341 --> 00:02:43.921
"That's a ridiculous idea!"

38
00:02:45.883 --> 00:02:47.483
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

39
00:02:48.704 --> 00:02:51.205
It was only loud enough for Roxy to hear, and no one else.

40
00:02:51.225 --> 00:02:57.689
"I'm tired of talking about Rocket Girl," Roxy told her friends.

41
00:02:57.709 --> 00:03:01.371
"I'm going to see if Principal Penn needs help with anything."

42
00:03:04.776 --> 00:03:07.959
Roxy walked down an empty hallway and made sure no one was around.

43
00:03:10.681 --> 00:03:12.303
Then she pressed a button on her watch.

44
00:03:13.544 --> 00:03:14.945
A small screen blinked on.

45
00:03:15.865 --> 00:03:18.147
Mayor Bloom, the mayor of Metro City, appeared.

46
00:03:19.088 --> 00:03:20.009
He didn't look happy.

47
00:03:20.029 --> 00:03:22.271
"What's wrong, Mayor?"

48
00:03:22.611 --> 00:03:23.232
asked Roxy.

49
00:03:23.252 --> 00:03:26.274
"A strange object landed at Mr.

50
00:03:26.294 --> 00:03:28.296
Mann's farm," said Mayor Bloom.

51
00:03:29.257 --> 00:03:30.898
"We think it might be a spaceship."

52
00:03:30.918 --> 00:03:32.880
"A spaceship?

53
00:03:33.868 --> 00:03:34.589
With aliens?"

54
00:03:35.069 --> 00:03:35.709
asked Roxy.

55
00:03:35.729 --> 00:03:38.712
"We're not sure," said Mayor Bloom.

56
00:03:38.732 --> 00:03:41.934
"But whatever it is, we need to find out.

57
00:03:43.135 --> 00:03:44.336
I talked to Principal Penn.

58
00:03:45.537 --> 00:03:48.219
She said you can leave school until we solve this case.

59
00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.161
We're counting on you, Rocket Girl."

60
00:03:51.181 --> 00:03:54.723
"I'm on my way," said Roxy.
